    {
      "part": "Points and Degrees",
      "number": "4",
      "title": "Cardinal and intercardinal points in degrees",
      "commentary": [
        "A full compass card is divided into 32 points; one point = 360°/32 = 11.25°.",
        "The 8 cardinal points are each bisected by an intercardinal point (NNE, ENE, ESE, SSE, SSW, WSW, WNW, NNW, every 22.5°); a further 16 three-letter points complete the full 32-point compass card."
      ],
