      "title": "Single-letter flag signals (most commonly used)",
      "commentary": [
        "This list covers the most frequently used and memorized single-letter signals; it is NOT the complete ICS alphabet (some less common letters are omitted) — the full table is in the International Code of Signals book / bridge flag chart."
